{"product_id":"iqos-terea-yugen-dimensions","title":"IQOS Terea Yugen Dimensions","description":"\u003cp\u003eIQOS TEREA Dimensions Yugen is the perfect device for a unique and satisfying smoking experience. Carefully crafted with a special blend of tobacco, ripe fruit and floral aromas, the device heats rather than burns resulting in a cleaner and smoother smoking. Enjoy the unique mix of sensations for a truly enjoyable experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese newly designed sticks are to be used only with IQOS Iluma, which features an auto-start function that detects when the \u003ca title=\"Terea Stick\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/terea-cigarette\"\u003eTerea stick\u003c\/a\u003e is inserted and automatically turns on the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":41764577902647,"sku":"Terea Yugen Dimensions - Pack","price":860.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41764577935415,"sku":"Terea Yugen Dimension - Carton","price":7250.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/terea-cigarette-dimensions-yugen.webp?v=1751934043","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/iqos-terea-yugen-dimensions","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




